                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The EUR Data Repository (EDR) is an institutional repository using the Figshare platform which allows you to showcase your research and make it findable, citable, and reusable for others. This hands-on presentation will walk you through how to deposit a dataset in the EDR. It includes e.g. uploading the files, filling out the metadata form, and getting a DOI."
